			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% looks at you, %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes threaten to spill tears of joy.
			PRINTFORMW 「After I have already declared myself to you?」
			PRINTFORML 「Fufufu... Don't get me wrong, I am almost mad at you for this little stunt...」
