		PRINTFORMW 「I'm couldn't be any happier right now, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%...」
		PRINTFORMDW You remain entangled in each other's confessed love for a good long while.
		CALL K93_TIMEPASSDOTS(10, "w")
		PRINTFORMW 「The words you have said, the love you have given me... I accept it all.」
