				PRINTFORML 「I believe in you and I believe in your strength, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
				PRINTFORMW 「And I believe that you have the will to let your feelings reach me.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Whatever those feelings may be... I have no reason to ever reject you.」
