				PRINTFORMW 「You understand that... don't you?」
				PRINTFORMDL Your sigh and nod are met with a meek clap from %HIM_HER(93, 0)%.
				PRINTFORMW 「Good! Now, allow me to tell you something that happened the other day...」
			ENDIF
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「You have been acting a bit strange lately...」
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% looks at you with a worried expression and a faint blush on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% cheeks.
			PRINTFORML 「Whatever it is, I hope you know that I wouldn't mind listening.」
			PRINTFORMW 「But if you don't want to tell me, maybe we can just talk about something else!」
		ENDIF
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMDW Your heart calms itself as you go back to having a casual conversation with %K93NICK()%.
		PRINTFORMDW ...It is what it is, but there is always next time.
	ENDIF
ENDIF
