@M_KOJO_EN_MESSAGE_COM_K93_354_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
;COM_ABLE354 dictates that this is only accessible with the [Love] talent, see what I mean when i say this game is [Lust]phobic?
;good thing is, no real need to check for fall states except for [Lover]
IF LOCAL
	IF CFLAG:93:衰弱 || CFLAG:93:お招き || CFLAG:93:睡眠 ;character is asleep
		PRINTFORML 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%... you're late...」
		PRINTFORMDW Barely awake, %K93NICK()% smiles as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% scooches closer to you.
	ELSE
		SELECTCASE RAND:3
		CASE 0
			PRINTFORML 「Here %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, come in!」
			IF GROUPMATCH(TIME:5, 4, 5, 6, 14) ;weather is rain, heavy rain, drizzle, rainstorm
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% rolls to the other side of the %K93_PRINTBED()%, making space for you.
				PRINTFORML 「Lying with your beloved someone while the rain patters and patters outside...」
				PRINTFORMW 「There is nothing much else a %PRINT_MALE("man", 93)% could ask for, is there?」
			ELSEIF DAY:2 == 4 ;winter
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% lifts %HIS_HER(93, 0)% thick duvet, showing you its warm underside.
				PRINTFORML 「It's pretty chilly out there, since it's winter and all.」
				PRINTFORMW 「So I've warmed up your side with all of my love～!」
				PRINTFORMW 「So come, and let me rid you of any cold you might have...」
			ELSEIF DAY:2 == 2 ;summer
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% beckons you to come closer, %HIS_HER(93, 0)% skin glistening with sweat.
				PRINTFORML 「It's a bit too hot out there %K93_DAYANDNIGHT("today")%, but I don't mind...」
				PRINTFORML 「We can always let our skins out bare, if truly needed～!」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% beckons you to join %HIM_HER(93, 0)% under blankets.
			ENDIF
		CASE 1
			IF K93_UNREQUITED(1)
				PRINTFORML 「Looking to join me in bed, are you?」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% says, throwing you a sly smile.
				PRINTFORMW 「Don't you already have someone else for that, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%?」
				PRINTFORML 「I'm not going to stop you, but you should consider spending more time with your lover.」
				PRINTFORMW 「But I must confess, I wouldn't mind sharing you in a three-way cuddle... Fufufu～!」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「Come on in, I've warmed up your spot for you.」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% tenderly invites you to lay by %HIS_HER(93, 0)% side.
				PRINTFORMW 「It's the least I can do after all you have given me, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
			ENDIF
		CASE 2
			IF K93_CANHUGRECOVER()
				PRINTFORMW 「Ready to end the day? You look like you need it.」
				PRINTFORML 「Come here, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, allow me to help you settle down.」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% moves back, giving you space to lie at %HIS_HER(93, 0)% side.
				PRINTFORMW 「You deserve a good rest, along with all the love I can give you.」
			ELSEIF !ONCE("WaggyHugRecover", 1, 93)
				PRINTFORMW 「Hmhmmm～! Finally decided that you need some rest, didn't you?」
				PRINTFORML 「Then come, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, allow me to relieve you of any exhaustion...」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% beams a smile, warmly beckoning you to bed.
				PRINTFORMW 「Don't refrain, you know you deserve a good rest more than anyone else.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Hoooh, you wish to lie by my side?」
				PRINTFORML 「It used to be so lonely, having no one to share a bed with.」
				PRINTFORMW 「But that has changed thanks to you, hasn't it? Fufufu!」
				PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% beams you a warm smile, beckoning you with both arms.
				PRINTFORMW 「So come here, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, before I start to feel lonely without you～」
			ENDIF
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% eagerly scooches closer to you as you lay by %HIS_HER(93, 0)% side.
		ENDSELECT
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
