IF LOCAL
	SIF !SHIRAHU(93)
		RETURN 1
	SIF K93_MAD()
		RETURN 1
	
	;a player complained about waggy talking as if she was assisting you, even though she wasn't
	;but now that i think about it, not a lot of characters have a check for this, so shouldn't this problem be more widespread?
	;someone should do something about that!
	;...someone.
	IF DISH_ASSI != 93
		IF TALENT:93:恋人
			PRINTFORML 「Are you sure you don't want my help, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%?」
			PRINTFORML 「It is my duty to do so as your %PRINT_MALE("man_:woman", 93)%, you know...」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% says, looking up at you with a faint pout.
		ELSEIF K93_LOVE_LUST_LOVER()
			PRINTFORMW 「I don't wish to insist... but are you sure you don't want my help?」
			PRINTFORML 「That's okay, I will just wait here for you to be finished.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu... I can't wait to see what sort of dish you come up with～!」
		ELSEIF K93_YEARNING_SEXFRIEND(1)
			PRINTFORML 「Oh, y-you're saying you don't want my help with cooking?」
			PRINTFORMW 「Fwuuuh.... I suppose that is fine... I will wait here for you to be finished.」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「Oh, are you going to cook something for yourself?」
			PRINTFORML 「Do let me know if I could be of any help, but if you don't need any...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Well, then I suppose that is fine, too.」
		ENDIF
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF

	IF TALENT:93:恋人
		PRINTFORML 「Helping your loved one in the kitchen... what a good couple that we are～!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Now, what can your dear %PRINT_MALE("husband", 93)% do for you?」
	ELSEIF K93_LOVE_LUST_LOVER()
		PRINTFORML 「Helping you with cooking almost makes it seem like we are a proper couple.」
		PRINTFORMW 「I think we are missing just the wedding ring and the matching aprons～!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu... Putting all jests to the side, what are we doing today?」
	ELSEIF K93_YEARNING_SEXFRIEND(1)
		PRINTFORML 「Having me help you with cooking almost feels like we...」
		PRINTFORMW 「No, f-forget I said anything! This is just helping a good friend.」
		PRINTFORMW 「What are you thinking of preparing right now?」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「I don't mind giving you a hand for cooking.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Just know that I'm not that good at this sort of thing...」
		PRINTFORMW 「Still, what do you have in mind?」
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% listens attentively as you describe %HIM_HER(93, 0)% the dish you want to make.
	PRINTL
	SELECTCASE FLAG:料理
	CASE 493 ;Mermaid Parfait, Waggy's special dish, "A blue ocean parfait inspired by the Little Mermaid. Just looking at it makes you feel refreshed."
		;the few commented out lines in here are alternates in case her special dish becomes a tayaki parfait instead of a regular parfait
		PRINTFORML 「You want some help with making a Mermaid Parfait, is that it?」
		IF FIRSTTIME("WaggyTeachMermaidParfait", 0, 93)
			PRINTFORMW 「Well, I wouldn't mind teaching you, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!」
			PRINTFORMW 「Making a parfait is easier than you think, especially in the last few years.」
			PRINTFORML 「I usually have %K93_HONORIFIC(73)% bring me ingredients from the Human Village.」
			PRINTFORMW 「...But it seems that you have some with you right now!」
			PRINTFORML 「So, here is what you want to do first...」
			;CALL K93_TIMEPASSDOTS(, "w")
			;PRINTFORMW 「Shaping the tayaki by hand is quite fun, but it requires a bit of finesse to do it.」
			;PRINTFORML 「Just don't forget to shape its mouth open, and don't completely fill it with anko.」
			;PRINTFORMW 「There must still be space for the yogurt and the fruits for each layer, after all...」
			;PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% closely guides in you in shaping, baking and filling the fish-shaped dough.
			;PRINTFORMDW After that, %HE_SHE(93, 0)% helps you with putting layers of fruits and yogurt inside the tayaki.
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% helps you with putting layers of fruits and yogurt inside a glass jar, one on top of each other.
			CALL K93_TIMEPASSDOTS(, "w")
			PRINTFORMW 「Of course, you can put whichever fruits you like for each layer.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I do like blueberries the best, although the blue coloring doesn't come from them.」
			PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% stops for a moment, %HIS_HER(93, 0)% lips curling into a faint smile.
			PRINTFORMW 「Yes, it's quite funny how despite the name blueberries are purple more than anything.」
			PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% then points to a small bag to your side.
			PRINTFORMW 「The blue color actually comes from that strange colored powder...」
			CALL K93_TIMEPASSDOTS(, "w")
			PRINTFORMW 「You are curious on how we make the parfait chill even if it isn't winter, correct?」
			;PRINTFORML 「You are curious on how we make both the parfait and the tayaki chill if it isn't winter, correct?」
			PRINTFORML 「As I've found out some time ago, the bottom of the Misty Lake gets very cold if you swim down to its deepest depths!」
			PRINTFORMW 「It's more than enough to make things cold, maybe even enough to make some proper ice cream.」
			PRINTFORMW 「But an ice scale will do just fine for refrigeration in a pinch.」
			PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% snaps an ice scale into two pieces with some struggle, and wraps both it and the jar in a piece of cloth.
			PRINTFORMW 「You just have to break one in half, wrap both halves around the jar and wait for a little while...」
			;PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% places the almost ready tayaki parfait inside a glass jar together with the ice scale.
			;PRINTFORMW 「Now you just wait for the ice scale to do its job...」
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% then places the jar on the counter and leans back into a more relaxed posture.
			PRINTFORMDW There's nothing to do now but wait, so you lean back and close your eyes as well.
			CALL K93_TIMEPASSDOTS(, "w")
			PRINTFORML 「And there you have it, a Mermaid Parfait of your own making!」
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% hands you the cold parfait jar while serving you an ice cap melting grin.
			;PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% hands you the cold tayaki parfait while serving you an ice cap melting grin.
			PRINTFORMW 「Do tell me if you like how it turned out, just make sure to eat it slowly.」
			PRINTFORML 「Or maybe... W-well, if you want to share it with me, I wouldn't complain, either...」
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% whispers, shyly looking away from you.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「Well, I won't mind assisting you with another Mermaid Parfait, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!」
			CALL K93_TIMEPASSDOTS(, "w")
			SELECTCASE RAND:3 ;4
			CASE 0
				PRINTFORMW 「Yes, it's true that what inspired me to come up with this dish was a particular fairy tale.」
				PRINTFORMW 「It was "The Little Mermaid", a short story hailing from the waters far west.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Both the ending and exactly what inspired this recipe might come off as a bit morbid.」
				PRINTFORML 「But all in all, I personally fail to see any of it like that...」
				PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% ponders, scratching %HIS_HER(93, 0)% chin with a thoughtful expression.
			CASE 1
				PRINTFORMW 「I wonder what other fruits I could put in each layer.」
				PRINTFORMW 「So far I have only tried strawberries, blueberries, peaches and mangoes.」
				PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% looks at you with curiosity burning in %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes.
				PRINTFORMW 「Do you have any suggestion on what would taste nice in parfait?」
			CASE 2
				PRINTFORMW 「I wonder what else other than fruits and grain we could put in for an even better taste.」
				PRINTFORML 「Maybe some chocolate would do the trick? Or maybe even melted caramel...」
				PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% rests a hand over %HIS_HER(93, 0)% chin, letting %HIS_HER(93, 0)% imagination wander around.
				PRINTFORMW 「What about finding a way to cool it even further, like %K93_HONORIFIC(14)%'s ice cream?」
				PRINTFORML 「Or maybe even something that I...」
				PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% continues to explore a few ideas out loud while the parfait cools down.
			;CASE 3 ;inspired by www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/44867052
				;PRINTFORMW 「Say, what do you think about opening a tayaki parfait shop?」
				;PRINTFORMW 「I know it's a bit far-fetched, but I'm already thinking of a few names for it.」
				;PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()%'s eyes sparkle as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% indulges %HIS_HER(93, 0)% fantasies out loud.
				;PRINTFORMW 「Tayakihime, Wakayaki... Maybe I could even change the shape to resemble a mermaid!」
				;PRINTFORMW 「I wonder if something like that would have a lot of costumers...」
			ENDSELECT
			CALL K93_TIMEPASSDOTS(, "w")
			SELECTCASE ABL:MASTER:料理技能
			CASE IS >= 5
				PRINTFORML 「Oh my! This one came out looking perfect, a piece of art!」
				PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% gives you a quick, quiet round of applause.
				PRINTFORMW 「You could serve it in a fancy restaurant and I wouldn't bat an eye.」
				PRINTFORML 「I sure hope you are going to share this one with me...」
				PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% says, mouth watering with desire at your parfait.
			CASE IS >= 3
				PRINTFORML 「Hooah! This is a good looking parfait if I ever saw one!」
				PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% gives you a genuine, sincere smile.
				PRINTFORML 「I think it's fair to say you've surpassed me on my own personal recipe.」
				PRINTFORMW 「But that means that I just have to get better, isn't it?」
			CASEELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「It seems to have turned just fine this time.」
				PRINTFORML 「As I'm sure you know, there is always room for improvement!」
				PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% smiles, speaking to you with a gentle tone.
				PRINTFORMW 「And a bit of more practice on your part wouldn't hurt, either.」
			ENDSELECT
		ENDIF
		RETURN 1
	CASE 463 ;Wild Game Dish, Kagerou's special dish
		PRINTFORML 「This is %K93_HONORIFIC(63)%'s special recipe, isn't it?」
		PRINTFORMW 「It's such a hearty meal! You eat it in the morning and won't be going hungry for the whole day!」
		PRINTFORMW 「While %HE_SHE(63, 0)% has taught me how to make it, I would still like to leave the meat preparation to you.」
		PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% pauses and looks at the ingredients for a second before speaking again.
		PRINTFORMW 「I'm not very good with handling things like that, you see.」
	CASE 473 ;Flying Head Manjuu, Sekibanki's special dish
		PRINTFORMW 「This is %K93_HONORIFIC(73)%'s specialty dish, is it not?」
		PRINTFORMW 「It was not easy, but I did convince %HIM_HER(73, 0)% to teach me how to do it.」
		PRINTFORML 「Even though I can't stomach the spiciness, shaping and filling the dough is quite fun～!」
		PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% smiles, ready to model the batter into cute little detached heads.
	CASEELSE
		IF STRCOUNT(DISH_TASTE, "魚料理") ;anything that's tagged as fish dish
			PRINTFORMW 「Hoooh, %DISHNAME_TR(DISHNAME)% requires fish to be prepared, doesn't it?」
			PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% covers %HIS_HER(93, 0)% mouth with a serious expression.
			PRINTFORMW 「Then... I would rather leave that part to you, I hope you understand why.」
			IF !FIRSTTIME("WaggyFishRuse", 1, 93)
				PRINTFORML 「Yes, while I don't mind your fishing, and living things eat each other...」
				PRINTFORMW 「Gutting and preparing repulses me quite a lot.」
				PRINTFORMW 「So I'm afraid it's not something that I can really help you with.」
				PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% then looks at you with a sincere smile.
				PRINTFORMW 「I wouldn't mind preparing the seasonings and everything else, however!」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「W-well, it's true that both youkai and humans eat what they have to eat, but...」
				PRINTFORMW 「If cooking is involved, I'd rather just not see it, no need to bribe me.」
				PRINTFORML 「Y-yes, c-cooking and eating is morally different from f-fishing, you see!」
				PRINTFORMDW %HIS_HER(93, 1)% stuttering picks up as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% looks away from you.
				PRINTFORMW 「I just hope you... don't mind if I help with other things instead.」
			ENDIF
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% settles on preparing seasonings and setting up the fire as you handle the fish itself.
		ELSE
			PRINTDATAL
				DATAFORM 「That one seems to be simple enough, as long as I have your assistance.」
				DATAFORM 「I'm not very familiar with that one, so I will let you take the lead」\n「Whatever happens, I'm sure it will be a learning experience for us both!」
				DATAFORM 「Hoooah! That one sounds delicious, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!」\n「I can't wait to try it out later...」
				DATAFORM 「Oh, that sounds like it's quite tasty.」\n「I hope you will share it with me, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
			ENDDATA
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% happily helps you in your cooking endeavors.
		ENDIF
	ENDSELECT
	CALL K93_TIMEPASSDOTS(, "w")
	SELECTCASE ABL:MASTER:料理技能
	CASE IS >= 5
		PRINTFORML 「Oh my! Is it really necessary that we eat this edible, masterfully crafted %DISHNAME_TR(DISHNAME)%?」
		PRINTFORMDW %HIS_HER(93, 1)% eyes sparkle as they lay on the plate you had both prepared.
		PRINTFORML 「It looks so good, makes me wish we could just leave it there so it can be admired.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Almost makes me feel proud, even though you did almost everything yourself...」
	CASE IS >= 3
		PRINTFORML 「Oh, it came out looking delicious, like something that would be served in a restaurant.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Let's just hope that it tastes as good as it looks!」
	CASEELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「Fwaaaah... It was a bit difficult that we were able to at least follow the recipe.」
		PRINTFORML 「There is definitely room for improvement, but I suppose that comes with time.」
		PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% says, giving you a reassuring smile.
	ENDSELECT
ENDIF
RETURN 1
