			PRINTFORMDL You look down, only to notice %CALLNAME:TARGET% smiling at you, a thick duvet covering you both.
			PRINTFORMDL Rain gently patters on the soil outside and on the roof above you...
			PRINTW
			PRINTFORMW 「You're finally awake, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!」
			PRINTFORML 「I wasn't planning to take a nap today, but then it started raining...」
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% tightens %HIS_HER(93, 0)% embrace, squeezing %HIS_HER(93, 0)% %OPPAI_DESCRIPTION_TR(93)% against you.
