		PRINTFORMW 「Mhmmm... I'm sorry to say, but I didn't like it that much.」
		IF K93_LOVE_LUST_LOVER()
			PRINTFORML 「But that's okay, having you here with me made it all worth it!」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% says, flashing you a sincere grin.
		ELSEIF K93_YEARNING_SEXFRIEND(1)
			PRINTFORML 「Maybe we could... c-come back here some other day?」
			PRINTFORMW 「I'm sure they will have a better cook in the kitchen, is all!」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% stutters out, nervously looking away from you.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「Maybe I should try ordering something different next time...」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% holds a sincere smile, despite looking a bit disappointed.
		ENDIF
	ENDIF
ENDIF
