IF LOCAL
	IF TFLAG:193 ;successful rent
		IF ITEM:101 ;martial arts guidebook
			PRINTFORML 「"Martial arts"... this is for fighting, is it not?」
			PRINTFORMW 「It's not something I'm interested in, I'm afraid...」
		ELSEIF ITEM:102 ;cookbook
			IF (K93_LOVE_LUST_LOVER() || CFLAG:93:K93EN_SEEWORLD >= 9) && RAND:2 ;small homage to her eratohok dialogue, great deal of inspiration to this dialogue
				PRINTFORML 「A cookbook... You know, that me think of something just now.」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% closes %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes and lets a gentle smile rise on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% face.
				PRINTFORMW 「Sometimes I like to imagine myself opening a restaurant someday.」
				PRINTFORMW 「To serve a lot of customers, get better and better at cooking, seeing people smile...」
				PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu, I doubt I would be able to deal with so much attention.」
				PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% opens %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes again, and gives you an inquisitive look.
				PRINTFORMW 「Do you have any daydreams like that, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%?」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「A cookbook? Are you going to use it to cook something nice?」
				PRINTFORMW 「Do let me know if you do, I would be happy to taste what you come up with.」
			ENDIF
		ELSEIF ITEM:103 ;dictionary
			PRINTFORML 「A dictionary? Isn't that the type of book that has a wide collection words?」
			PRINTFORMW 「I have been told that my vocabulary gets a bit complex sometimes, despite never reading one.」
			PRINTFORMW 「But what do you think, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%? Do I really use complicated words that often?」
		ELSEIF ITEM:104 ;short novel
			PRINTFORML 「That's a short story, isn't it? Let me see, maybe it's one of the few that I'm familiar with.」
			PRINTFORMDW Filled with curiosity, %K93NICK()% leans closer to look at the short novel you just rented.
			PRINTFORMW 「...No, I'm afraid I'm not familiar with this one. But it still looks like a good book!」
		ELSEIF ITEM:105 ;music instructions manual
			PRINTFORML 「I find it hard to believe that music has so many rules to it.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Whenever I sing, I just listen to whatever my heart tells me to do!」
		ELSEIF ITEM:106 ;picture book
			PRINTFORML 「Hoooh, is that a book with only pictures in it?」
			IF TALENT:93:育児中 && CFLAG:93:出産経過日 <= CHILD_自立前 ;child or younger
				PRINTFORMW 「I think our little %K93_CHILDHONORIFIC(93, TALENT:93:育児中)% would enjoy it a lot!」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「It's interesting, to tell a story without using words...」
			ENDIF
		ELSEIF ITEM:107 ;fishing picture book
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()%'s eyes sparkle as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% looks at the fishing book you just rented.
			PRINTFORMW 「Hoooah! A book that talks about nothing but fish!」
			PRINTFORMW 「Do you think it has anything about mermaids?」
			PRINTFORMDW The shine in %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes dim as you slowly shake your head.
			PRINTFORMW 「...Even if it doesn't, I'm sure it's still an interesting read.」
		ELSEIF ITEM:108 ;foraging guide
			PRINTFORML 「That has a lot of information on plants, mushrooms and animals, doesn't it?」
			PRINTFORMW 「I'm sure it's a very fun read, even if you don't plan on going out in the wild.」
		ELSEIF ITEM:109 ;pharmacy textbook
			PRINTFORMW 「A pharmacy book... Does that help with making medicine?」
			IF TALENT:93:調合Lv >= 2
				PRINTFORMW 「Ever since you've started teaching me, I have been able to understand a thing or two.」
				PRINTFORML 「But it's still such a complicated subject for me, no matter how much I read about it...」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% nods from time to time as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% flips through a few pages of the book.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「I'm afraid I can't make head nor tail from anything that's written in it...」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% flips through the book, confusion further settling as the pages go by.
			ENDIF
		ELSEIF ITEM:110 ;lumberjack's primer
			PRINTFORML 「A book with instructions for cutting wood?」
			PRINTFORMW 「I didn't know that woodcutting was complex enough to warrant that!」
		ELSEIF ITEM:111 ;demon book, not sure if this even shows up, hopefully someone gets the nod that this is towards the miracle mallet
			PRINTFORMW 「Uhmm... Should you really be renting this, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%?」
			PRINTFORMW 「Looking at it gives me a... very familiar feeling... the energy it has...」
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% closes %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes and quickly shakes %HIS_HER(93, 0)% head.
			PRINTFORMW 「No, maybe I'm just overthinking it.」
		ELSE ;META
			PRINTFORMW 「Sorry, I don't have much of an idea of what this book is.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Maybe %K93_HONORIFIC(73)% would know something about it?」
			PRINTFORML 「But somehow, I feel like this book only got here very recently...」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% squints %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes on confusion while looking at the book.
		ENDIF
	ELSE ;book rented out
		PRINTFORML 「"Rented out"... That means it's unavailable for now.」
		PRINTFORMW 「That's a shame, but I'm sure you can come back another time for it!」
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
